 "headline": "No new counted winner. Pagonidis' IBS effect weakened after his 2013 paper (one-day rule +0.16% \u2192 +0.08% per trade before costs, now losing after costs); his RSI(3)+IBS rule still beats random timing but misses the bar across 31 ETFs (on QQQ alone PF 2.08). Katsanos' Stiffness only rides the Dow stocks' rise. Best return winner stays round 3's IBS rule on QQQ: 37.6% a year in TQQQ since 2010."
